        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, passenger car, methanol</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, passenger car, methanol
Average data for the operation of an Euro-3 Swiss passenger car.;
Synonyms: MeOH; 
UUID: 4f973682-7185-314e-aeda-c2611550bc1a
methanol, from biomass, at regional storage supplies are included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Heavy metal emissions to water and to soil are included. Tyre abrasion is included
Location: Data refers to average transport conditions and kilometric performance of different passenger car categories in Switzerland.
Technology: Euro3
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: National statistics, data from technical institutions and literature data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f973682-7185-314e-aeda-c2611550bc1a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
